{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sonate-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sonate-residences-condor-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","about":"Sonate Residences is a luxury multi–storey residential complex from the developer – Condor, located in the picturesque JVT area. The complex offers a wide range of elegant apartments with 1-3 bedrooms, designed in a harmonious style. On the territory of the complex, residents are offered a wide range of amenities carefully thought out to improve their daily lives: a communal swimming pool, a children's playground, a gym and fitness center, a tennis court for playing padel, an outdoor cinema, recreational areas, a picturesque park, jogging paths, as well as in the residential complex you can live with animals, which plays a very big role for pet lovers.Sonate Residences has a prime location close to key locations in Dubai. There are shops, schools and business districts in the immediate vicinity.There are green parks nearby that create harmony and tranquility in the hustle and bustle of the city.The school is 2 minutes away, Jumeirah Beach is 25 minutes away, and Dubai Marina, Burj Al Arab and Burj Khalifa are 20 minutes away.Combined with its exceptional location, superior amenities and sustainable lifestyle, Sonate Residences by Condor offers an incomparable lifestyle in the heart of a vibrant community. For those who seek luxury, comfort and environmental awareness, this residential complex is the perfect choice, representing the perfect combination of modern design and an exceptional lifestyle.","price":713598,"title":"Sonate Residences","bitrix":{"id":425,"pf_id":"are.2.13596","source":null,"project_id":"Sonate Residences","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sonate Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Condor","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.c